{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>朝鮮考慮恢復對韓國的擴音器喊話。</p><p></p><p>勞動黨中央委員會部長金與正指，韓國軍方從8月1日至10月17日進行擴音器廣播挑釁，高達2,870次，開槍警告達201次，稱韓方魯莽行為將令局勢惡化，招致嚴重災禍。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.SK-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262VlqqZfGy31792415405.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>金與正說針對目前形勢，朝鮮軍方正研究在南部邊境增強戰術打擊，和重啟對韓方進行擴音器廣播等措施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:52.808630+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:57.980135+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:38.768507+00:00","content_hash":"5e7d33ee42d5ceb2e5192dd8f42760e57ffd79be4f08c107bc389846a335e76f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}